{
  "info": {
    "name": "Massula Nerd House",
    "description": "Coleção de endpoints do backend da Massula Nerd House (Node.js + Express + Sequelize + PostgreSQL).\n\nAntes de executar:\n1. Suba o backend (npm run dev) e o Postgres (container Docker).\n2. Crie o primeiro usuário superadmin diretamente no banco, pois a criação de usuários exige token de superadmin:\n   INSERT INTO usuario (nome, nome_usuario, senha_hash, tipo, ativo)\n   VALUES ('Administrador', 'admin', '<hash bcrypt da senha>', 'superadmin', true);\n   Ex.: hash de 'senha12345' -> use bcrypt (npm i bcrypt) ou https://bcrypt.online\n3. No Postman, execute o request \"Login\" para obter o token (salvo automaticamente na variável \"token\").\n\nAs variáveis jogadorId, jogoId e partidaId são preenchidas automaticamente pelos testes dos requests de criação.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3000/api" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "jogadorId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "jogoId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "partidaId", "value": "1" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nome\": \"admin\",\n  \"senha\": \"senha12345\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Login retorna 200 e accessToken', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(body.accessToken).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty;",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', body.accessToken);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["health"] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Health retorna status ok', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().status).to.eql('ok');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Usuário",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Registrar usuário",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nome\": \"Administrador Teste\",\n  \"nome_usuario\": \"admin_teste\",\n  \"senha\": \"senha12345\",\n  \"tipo\": \"admin\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/usuario/registrar", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["usuario", "registrar"] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Registrar usuário retorna 201', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(body.nome_usuario).to.be.a('string');",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('usuarioId', body.id);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('Sem token retorna 401', function () {",
                  "  pm.sendRequest({ url: pm.request.url, method: 'POST', header: [], body: pm.request.body }, function (err, res) {",
                  "    pm.expect(res.code).to.eql(401);",
                  "  });",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar usuários",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/usuario/listar", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["usuario", "listar"] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Listar usuários retorna 200 e array', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.be.an('array');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
